pp with your request ready. Tap Send there so it reaches us.\",\"waButton\":\"Send via WhatsApp\",\"waAlso\":\"You can also send a copy of your request via WhatsApp:\",\"waIntro\":\"Request from the website\"},\"qr\":{\"title\":\"Site QR code\",\"text\":\"Point your phone camera at the code to open this site.\",\"alt\":\"QR code linking to this site\",\"share\":\"Share\",\"copied\":\"The site link has been copied.\",\"download\":\"Download QR code (SVG)\",\"localNote\":\"The site is opened as a local file, so the QR code points to a demo address. Once published, it will point to the live address.\"},\"accessibility\":{\"title\":\"Accessibility\",\"summary\":\"We ",
"want everyone to be able to use this site, including people with disabilities.\",\"more\":\"Accessibility statement\",\"items\":[\"The site follows the Israeli standard IS 5568 and the WCAG 2.1 guidelines at level AA.\",\"You can use the site with a keyboard, with screen readers and with text enlarged up to 200%.\",\"Images have text descriptions, and form fields have labels and clear error messages.\",\"The site works on phones and computers; Hebrew text runs right to left.\",\"The map and video load from third-party services only after you press a button; their accessibility is outside our control.\",\"If something is hard to use or does not work, contact us: {contact}. We will reply and try to help.\",\"Statement updated: {date}.\"]},\"privacy\":{\"title\":\"Privacy\",\"summary\":\"This site uses no cookies or ads. We use your details only to respond to your request.\",\"more\":\"More details\",\"items\":[\"This site uses no cookies, visitor counters or advertising systems.\",\"Your browser only stores the language you chose. This is not personal data, and you can remove it by clearing this site's data in your browser.\",\"Form data (name, phone, email, message) is used only to respond to your request. Requests are stored by the site host (Netlify) and reach us by email; if you send yours via WhatsApp, the text passes through WhatsApp. We do not share the data with anyone else or use it for mailings. You are not legally required to provide it, but without it we cannot reply.\",\"The OpenStreetMap map loads only when you press the button; at that moment OpenStreetMap receives your IP address. The WhatsApp, Telegram, Google Maps and Waze buttons open those services.\",\"The YouTube video loads only when you press the button; at that moment YouTube (Google) receives your IP address and may store data in your browser.\",\"To see, correct or delete your data, contact us: {contact}.\"],\"demoNote\":\"The form is currently in demo mode and collects no data.\"},\"footer